    <string name="settings_perm_files">All Files Access</string>
    <string name="settings_perm_calendar_why">Shows your events in the Calendar widget. Widget stacks also turn to the calendar when an event is coming up.</string>
    <string name="settings_perm_photos_why">For the Photos widget, photos in Search and the gallery when choosing a wallpaper.</string>
    <string name="settings_perm_contacts_why">Lets Search find your contacts.</string>
    <string name="settings_perm_location_why">Approximate location for the Weather widget. Without it, the widget uses a place you choose.</string>
    <string name="settings_perm_badges_why">Counts notifications per app to show the red badges on icons.</string>
    <string name="settings_perm_usage_why">Improves App Suggestions in Search and the App Library with apps you open outside the launcher, e.g. from a notification.</string>
    <string name="settings_perm_files_why">Lets Liquid Glass read the wallpaper set in Android (otherwise the launcher draws a stand-in) and lets Search find files other than photos.</string>
    <string name="settings_perm_footer">Everything is optional: without a permission only that feature is missing. Your data stays on your device; only the Weather widget sends its place (approximate location or the place you chose) to Open-Meteo.</string>
